{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the bedroom, the opening level of the full Stuck Together game. This is where your escape begins, as you and your partner learn to coordinate through the first room. In this single-room demo, you\u2019ll get a taste of the physics-based chaos, interactive objects, and teamwork challenges that await in the full five-room adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/72dd1f5f4cbed3530a031e4d9d6aec92.poster.avif?t=1755092843\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/72dd1f5f4cbed3530a031e4d9d6aec92.webm?t=1755092843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/72dd1f5f4cbed3530a031e4d9d6aec92.mp4?t=1755092843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buddy up online or locally in this two-player co-op adventure! Test your teamwork as you swing, scale, and navigate the home of an unhinged teenager. Learn to co-operate... or probably just rage quit. Has your friendship got what it takes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/4f93672f8c2153238129f4f4c1225f24.poster.avif?t=1755092843\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/4f93672f8c2153238129f4f4c1225f24.webm?t=1755092843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/4f93672f8c2153238129f4f4c1225f24.mp4?t=1755092843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAND-TAGONIST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s up with this sadistic kid? Outmanoeuvre the hand-tagonist, a tiny tyrant with way too much time on his <i>hands</i>. Just when you think you\u2019re getting somewhere, he\u2019ll pop up to squash your hopes of escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/5c470b902df5be874f08a3455f7c7c99.poster.avif?t=1755092843\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/5c470b902df5be874f08a3455f7c7c99.webm?t=1755092843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/5c470b902df5be874f08a3455f7c7c99.mp4?t=1755092843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE CLIMB</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer challenging, physics-based climbing where every grab, swing, and slip could be your last. Miss a jump and it\u2019s back to the floor, but isn\u2019t falling half the fun?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/fb5c1e2f233bb45806d1ba6efaa1e287.poster.avif?t=1755092843\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/fb5c1e2f233bb45806d1ba6efaa1e287.webm?t=1755092843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/fb5c1e2f233bb45806d1ba6efaa1e287.mp4?t=1755092843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90S NOSTALGIA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro toys, old tunes, chunky furniture, and enough 90s chaos to mend your childhood trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/78ab66193f21df380f452119d458ac20.poster.avif?t=1755092843\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/78ab66193f21df380f452119d458ac20.webm?t=1755092843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/78ab66193f21df380f452119d458ac20.mp4?t=1755092843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOME STRETCH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, explore the starting room of the full house. Experience the unique hazards, interactive objects, and increasingly unfair level design as you take your first steps towards freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/e2226256b0cdb652f1046bcd681b66f4.poster.avif?t=1755092843\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/e2226256b0cdb652f1046bcd681b66f4.webm?t=1755092843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839730/extras/e2226256b0cdb652f1046bcd681b66f4.mp4?t=1755092843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>P.S. If you don\u2019t escape the attic you\u2019re trash.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839730?t=1755092843","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_